  "groups": [
    {
      "all_of": [
        {
          "condition": "User prefers to decline evening invitations",
          "item": "e_00e619"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```

**Step 4: Confirm No Alternatives Needed**

- The policy does not include any "or" alternatives; thus, a single group suffices.

